{"name":"Demon Cultist","size":"medium","type":"humanoid","tag":"","alignment":"Evil","hitDice":"4","armorName":"none","shieldBonus":0,"natArmorBonus":3,"otherArmorDesc":"10","speed":"40","burrowSpeed":"0","climbSpeed":"0","flySpeed":"0","hover":false,"swimSpeed":"0","customHP":false,"customSpeed":true,"hpText":"14 (4d8 - 4)","speedDesc":"10m","strPoints":"10","dexPoints":"14","conPoints":"10","intPoints":"12","wisPoints":"18","chaPoints":"12","blindsight":"0","blind":false,"darkvision":"60","tremorsense":"0","truesight":"0","telepathy":0,"cr":"1","customCr":"1 (200 XP)","customProf":2,"isLegendary":false,"legendariesDescription":"The monster can take 3 legendary actions, choosing from the options below. Only one legendary action option can be used at a time and only at the end of another creature's turn. The monster regains spent legendary actions at the start of its turn.","isLair":false,"lairDescription":"When fighting inside its lair, the monster can invoke the ambient magic to take lair actions. On initiative count 20 (losing initiative ties), the monster can take one lair action to cause one of the following effects:","lairDescriptionEnd":"The monster can't repeat an effect until they have all been used, and it can't use the same effect two rounds in a row.","isMythic":false,"mythicDescription":"If the monster's mythic trait is active, it can use the options below as legendary actions for 1 hour after using {Some Ability}.","isRegional":false,"regionalDescription":"The region containing the monster's lair is warped by the creature's presence, which creates one or more of the following effects:","regionalDescriptionEnd":"If the monster dies, the first two effects fade over the course of 3d10 days.","properties":[],"abilities":[{"name":"Shadow Stealth","desc":"While in dim light or darkness, the [MON] can take the Hide action as a bonus action. While hidden his speed becomes 15m."}],"actions":[{"name":"Dagger","desc":"_Melee or Ranged Weapon Attack:_ [DEX ATK] to hit, reach 1m or range 6/18m, one target. _Hit:_ [DEX 1D6] piercing damage."},{"name":"Fire Bolt","desc":"_Melee Spell Attack:_ [WIS ATK] to hit, reach 36m, one target. _Hit:_ You hurl a mote of fire at a creature or object within range. Make a ranged spell attack against the target. On a hit, the target takes [WIS 1D10] fire damage. A flammable object hit by this spell ignites if it isn’t being worn or carried."},{"name":"Blur","desc":"_Melee Spell Attack:_ [WIS ATK] to hit, concentration, up to 1 minute, self. _Hit:_ Your body becomes blurred, shifting and wavering to all who can see you. For the duration, any creature has disadvantage on attack rolls against you. An attacker is immune to this effect if it doesn’t rely on sight, as with blindsight, or can see through illusions, as with truesight."}],"bonusActions":[],"reactions":[],"legendaries":[],"mythics":[],"lairs":[],"regionals":[],"sthrows":[{"name":"dex","order":1},{"name":"wis","order":4}],"skills":[{"name":"deception","stat":"cha"},{"name":"religion","stat":"int"},{"name":"stealth","stat":"dex"}],"damagetypes":[],"specialdamage":[{"name":"fire (x0.75)","note":" (Resistant)","type":"r"},{"name":"light (x2)","note":" (Vulnerable)","type":"v"},{"name":"shadow (x0.5)","note":" (Resistant)","type":"r"}],"conditions":[],"languages":[{"name":"Common","speaks":true},{"name":"Infernal","speaks":true}],"understandsBut":"","shortName":"","pluralName":"","doubleColumns":true,"separationPoint":0,"damage":[]}